{"type":"text","timestamp":1794560587459,"sessionID":"ses_e2bde2a21ffe162q7QQoGTpivB","part":{"id":"prt_1d42564a9001ooARryLOAqIAO7","sessionID":"ses_e2bde2a21ffe162q7QQoGTpivB","messageID":"msg_1d4253fa0001eakHpJl5H6X7TJ","type":"text","text":"T040 is implemented. The capture now omits per-row outcomes for holdout rows, and the slice test asserts it. The expected one red remains until T041 recaptures the committed baseline.\n\nFiles written:\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs` writes `rows`, `attachedRows` and `typedRowResults` only when `row.split !== 'holdout'`. Tallies are untouched. Comment added: a holdout row's outcome is what the split exists to keep unseen, so only its counts are published.\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts` adds `it('publishes no holdout row', ...)` and filters the row-by-row id list to non-holdout corpus ids.\n\nVerify output:\n\n```\n$ env -u AI_SESSION_CHILD npx vitest run tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts\n ❯ tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts (5 tests | 1 failed) 5285ms\n     × publishes no holdout row 3ms\n FAIL  tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts > command routing slice > publishes no holdout row\n AssertionError: the baseline publishes a per-row outcome for 44 holdout ids: expected [ …(44) ] to deeply equal []\n Test Files  1 failed (1)\n      Tests  1 failed | 4 passed (5)\n```\n\nThe 44 named ids run from `cmd-create-agent-plain-holdout-01` to `cmd-speckit-search-plain-holdout-01`. This is exactly the expected red that T041 clears by recapturing the baseline without holdout rows.\n\n```\n$ node --check .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs\nexit 0\n\n$ node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs | jq -c '.rows | length'\n132\n\n$ FLOOR\n{\"correct\":24,\"total\":44}\n{\"count\":0,\"total\":35}\n{\"own\":24,\"attached\":20,\"combined\":44,\"total\":44}\n{\"own\":8,\"attached\":15,\"combined\":23,\"total\":45}\n```\n\nThose four FLOOR lines equal lines 4 to 7 of `scratch/before.txt`.\n\nNothing in the task was left undone. I did not tick T040 or touch `command-routing-baseline.json`, and the scoped status lists only the two files above. Other modified files in the tree belong to other workers and were not touched.\n\nNext: T041 must run the recapture (`node .../capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs --write`) to clear the one expected failing case.","time":{"start":1794560582825,"end":1794560587459}}}
